# USSR startup configuration.
# ussr runs moscow.su from your home folder, then the one in the current
# folder (unless it is the same file), before a script or the REPL.
# USSR_MOSCOW names the only one to run instead; empty runs none.
# Put persistent shell setup commands here. Examples:
# set(home): "/home/user"
# cd(_): home
# alias(_): "ll" "ls" "-l"
# keybind(_): "Mod+F1" "help(_):"
# setenv(_): "PS1" "\u@\h \W\$ "
